cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Code and data for "Mapping the AI Research of China, the US and the EU"
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite both the software and
  the associated article.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Pigeon-Effect/qss_publication
abstract: >-
  Research compendium for a scientometric analysis of citation shares within
  AI subdisciplines derived from 1,986,659 OpenAlex records (2020-2025):
  keyword construction, OpenAlex data collection, dataset quality control,
  a semi-supervised hierarchical topic model (SPECTER embeddings, K-Means,
  expert consolidation), citation-impact analysis, visualization, and
  LLM-based cluster validation via document intrusion detection (adapted from
  the "reading tea leaves" paradigm of Chang et al. 2009) and Likert-scale
  coherence rating (following Tan and D'Souza 2025).
keywords:
  - scientometrics
  - topic modeling
  - cluster validation
  - intrusion detection
  - large language models
  - OpenAlex
  - artificial intelligence
  - citation analysis

